        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Open Viewing - Saturday the 11th of July from 11.00am to 11.30am\n\nRAY COOKE are delighted to present a number of exceptional new-build 1-bedroom apartment within the prestigious Tramway development, Tallaght, Dublin 24.\n\nDesigned with modern living in mind, this beautifully appointed apartment offers bright and spacious accommodation finished to an outstanding specification throughout. Featuring an open-plan living, dining and kitchen area, generous double bedroom, contemporary bathroom and carefully considered storage solutions, every element has been crafted to provide comfort, style and convenience.\n\nThe Tramway represents a new standard of urban living, combining high-quality design with a superb location in the heart of Tallaght. Residents will enjoy immediate access to an unrivalled range of amenities including The Square Shopping Centre, Tallaght Hospital, TU Dublin Tallaght Campus, cafés, restaurants, gyms and leisure facilities. The development also benefits from excellent transport links with the Luas Red Line, numerous Dublin Bus routes and the M50 motorway all within easy reach, making commuting to Dublin City Centre and beyond effortless. Tallaght is recognised as one of Dublin's most established and rapidly growing residential hubs, offering an exceptional blend of convenience, connectivity and community.\n\nWhether you are a first-time buyer, downsizer or investor seeking a high-quality property in a thriving location, this stunning apartment presents a rare opportunity to acquire a brand-new home in one of Dublin's most exciting developments.\n\nKey Features:\n* Brand-new 1-bedroom apartment\n* A-rated energy-efficient design (subject to final certification)\n* Contemporary kitchens and bathrooms\n* Help To Buy Scheme Available\n* Spacious open-plan layout\n* Excellent specification throughout\n* Exceptional transport links including Luas and M50\n* Walking distance to shopping, healthcare, education and leisure amenities\n* Ideal for first-time buyers, downsizers and investors\n* Developed within the sought-after Tramyard scheme\n\nEarly registration of interest is strongly advised."
      },
      {
